Now for the column:
losses_liab_no gamma (the defined logic : [ Sum of (Scenario 1{sum_partial_dv01 group by currency, asset_holding = liability*Shocks}0.25+{sum_partial_dv01 * Shocks }0.5+….+{sum_partial_dv01* Shocks }30)]*100 for asset_holding = liability

what it is? For the given SECURITY_CURRENCY and asset_holding= "Liability", map it with the CURRENCY in the irr_ear_reporting_rf_ear_shocks_raw. And for every currency, we will find 5000 scenarios in the column "SCENARIO"
and the shock value associted to each scenario in the "Shock" column.

Now for the "losses_liab_no gamma" Column, we need to multiply the Sum_partial_dv01 from 2.1 table(irr_ear_reporting_partial_dv01) with the each scenario shock value for all the tenors.
Example, for AUD currency, we will have 10 tenor columns (0.25 to 30). So for each scenario (Example Scenario value "1"), the sum_partial_dv01 value must be multiplied and sum the individual tenor, scenario values for all tenors at last.
Once we sumed up, the value needs to be multipled with 100. This process continues for all 5000 scenarios.

